{"municipality_code":"04505","pref":"宮城県","city":"美里町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"美里町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には城跡や陣屋跡、古墳や貝塚、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「不動堂要害跡」、「彫堂城跡」、「山前遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では三塚博や鈴木大吉に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「山神社」や「山前遺跡」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":1,"rank":1642,"percentile":9.9,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":6,"rank":1043,"percentile":42.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":29,"rank":885,"percentile":51.6,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":5,"rank":1362,"percentile":21.0,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":5,"rank":804,"percentile":50.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":17,"rank":886,"percentile":51.9,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["三塚博","鈴木大吉","鈴木大亮","袖井林二郎","千葉亀雄"],"tourism_la